    "description": "Discover GBA classic legendary emulation game and play inside the same app. This GBA emulator is a super fast and full-featured emulator to run gameboy advance games at high speed. It emulates nearly all aspects of the real hardware correctly.\r\nLet\u2019s start a wonderful gaming experience with this game emulator!\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udc49 How to play GBA Emulator: Classic gameboy?\r\n1. Visit website you want to download then select your favorite gameboy games\r\n2. Click download. After successfully downloading, the game is stored in download folder under file manager app\r\n3. Back to GBA emulator app, tap scan games button to import games into this emulator app. \r\n4. Enjoy your gaming time!! \r\n\r\n\ud83c\udfae GBA Emulator: Classic gameboy highlight features:\r\n- Simulate 1000+ games emulator from many popular websites\r\n-  Detailed guides for downloading game & scanning games are included\r\n-  Fast emulation, therefore saves your battery.\r\n- Fully customizable themes: various choice for you\r\n- Covers advanced settings: save state, load state, fast forward...\r\n- Allows user to enhance emulation speed\r\n- A very powerful screen layout editor, with which you can define the position and size for each of the on-screen controls, as well as for the game video.\r\n- Friendly interface, easy to use & very high game compatibility. \r\n\r\nNote: No games are included in this app so you need to download it yourself. A details guidance on how to download games is included in the app. It just takes few seconds. Enjoy your childhood games!\r\n\r\nPrivacy Policy: http://metaverselabs.ai/privacy-policy/\r\nTerms of use: http://metaverselabs.ai/terms-of-use/\r\nSupport: support@metaverselabs.ai\r\n\r\nWe are working our best on making the GBA Emulator: Classic gameboy app more useful for you. We'd very much appreciate if you have any recommendations/suggestions for us to get good product. Your kind words encourage us greatly. If you have any questions, don't hesitate to contact our support email. Thank you.",
